@lam/keyring is a Lammergeier third-party library for sealing secrets at rest
(AES-256-GCM key rings, key rotation and envelope keys). It uses only the Go
standard library cryptography packages, distributed under the BSD-style
license of The Go Authors.

The sealed-value format is compatible with the SecretBox of the
managed-file-transfer application, from which this library was extracted.
